      "role": "user",
      "content": "the fabric is definitely fine, we use this exact same roll for all our other clients and it works every time. we've even checked for wrinkles and it's laid completely flat. the spots where it's failing are really localized and random, it doesn't follow a pattern like a wrinkle would. it's like part of the ink just vanishes. is there any other chemical reason why the dye wouldn't stay put?",
      "source": "evaluator"
